OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors producer 'amazed by
OL,4,Areaction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith much of the country gripped by the
OL,7,Flatest series of The Celebrity
OL,8,FTraitors, the man behind the show has
OL,9,Ftold the BBC he has been "amazed by the
OL,10,Freaction" to it.
OL,12,FStephen Lambert is the chief executive
OL,13,Fof Studio Lambert - the company which
OL,14,Fhas produced the programme, and its
OL,15,Fcivilian version, for the BBC since
OL,16,F2022.
OL,18,FAlongside The Traitors, the production
OL,19,Fcompany is also responsible for hits
OL,20,Fincluding Race Across the World,
OL,21,FGogglebox and Squid Game: The
OL,22,FChallenge.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
