OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors producer 'amazed by
OL,4,Areaction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe TV producer first started the
OL,7,Fcompany in 2008, and was speaking to
OL,8,FBBC Radio Oxford ahead of an event at
OL,9,Fthe city's Schwarzman Centre on
OL,10,FThursday evening.
